      "code": "ctx->digits = DEC_MAX_DIGITS;",
      "note": "jq widens the DEC_INIT_BASE decimal context to `DEC_MAX_DIGITS` without preserving decNumber's 32-bit compare invariant. With `ctx->emax = 999999999` and `ctx->emin = -999999999`, this makes the minimum subnormal exponent `ctx->emin - ctx->digits + 1 = -1999999997`, so a later exponent delta can exceed `INT32_MAX`. The fix replaces this assignment with `INT32_MAX - (ctx->emax - ctx->emin - 1)`.",
